{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Night Market Simulation \u2013 Demo Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers an early preview of the Night Market Simulation. In the demo version, players can set up a basic store, sell a limited selection of products, and experience initial customer interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features Included in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your business in a limited space by opening a small store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offer a restricted selection of products from specific categories (food &amp; beverages, cleaning supplies, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange your store using a few shelving and equipment options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic interaction and shopping system with customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic payment systems (cash/card)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">View your sales through an end-of-day report</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version provides limited content and gives players the opportunity to try out the core mechanics of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will include more features, a wider range of products, store expansion options, and advanced systems. However, this demo contains only the basic experiences listed above.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3233420?t=1744401383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233420/498922761ec03d96e09814e522262fc40dcbed27/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744401383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233420/60a806aaf5731a03d71797b282b1f106ca6847b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744401383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app